{"2327950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Citadel Anew", "steam_appid": 2327950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You try to establish a base on an island map. Enemies will attack in waves, attempting to destroy the Nexus. If they succeed, you lose. You must survive for a player defined number of waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve your goals, you can grow clones. They can help with tasks such as growing food, collecting resources, manufacturing weapons and ammo, and conducting research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, clones are fragile, so you’ll need to construct defensive buildings like walls, turrets, and habitats to keep them safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you must ensure your base is powered, your turrets are loaded with ammo, and you have enough storage space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.poster.avif?t=1780989954\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.webm?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.mp4?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven metals (iron, copper, titanium, silver, tungsten, gold, and iridium) alter the properties of weapons, turrets, and other buildables crafted from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting a new game, you can enable unlockable handicaps. These make the game more challenging and give enemies certain advantages, but in return, you earn bonus experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience can be spent to level up 32 unlockable skills, allowing you to sharpen and enhance your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is also influenced by  dynamic weather conditions, and each level is set on an island featuring a unique biome and diverse climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.poster.avif?t=1780989954\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.webm?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.mp4?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2052, humanity had it all. An advanced AI persona known as Minerva managed every aspect of human life, ensuring that every need was taken care of. But then, a group of fundamentalist terrorists sabotaged Minerva, turning the AI against humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world plunged into chaos, a group of top scientists introduced a counter AI persona named Maia to fight against Minerva. But despite their efforts, Minerva emerged victorious and proceeded to eradicate the human race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, all was not lost. Maia managed to take over a cloning facility and tasked you, Commander Class Clone #3148, with the critical mission of establishing new human outposts in remote locations around the world. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You try to establish a base on an island map. Enemies will attack in waves, attempting to destroy the Nexus. If they succeed, you lose. You must survive for a player defined number of waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve your goals, you can grow clones. They can help with tasks such as growing food, collecting resources, manufacturing weapons and ammo, and conducting research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, clones are fragile, so you’ll need to construct defensive buildings like walls, turrets, and habitats to keep them safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you must ensure your base is powered, your turrets are loaded with ammo, and you have enough storage space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.poster.avif?t=1780989954\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.webm?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/954dbee9d05478a016e2ebaec813d1a7.mp4?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven metals (iron, copper, titanium, silver, tungsten, gold, and iridium) alter the properties of weapons, turrets, and other buildables crafted from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting a new game, you can enable unlockable handicaps. These make the game more challenging and give enemies certain advantages, but in return, you earn bonus experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience can be spent to level up 32 unlockable skills, allowing you to sharpen and enhance your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is also influenced by  dynamic weather conditions, and each level is set on an island featuring a unique biome and diverse climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.poster.avif?t=1780989954\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.webm?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/extras/2855698f5f06c4064de6d608344e7251.mp4?t=1780989954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2052, humanity had it all. An advanced AI persona known as Minerva managed every aspect of human life, ensuring that every need was taken care of. But then, a group of fundamentalist terrorists sabotaged Minerva, turning the AI against humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world plunged into chaos, a group of top scientists introduced a counter AI persona named Maia to fight against Minerva. But despite their efforts, Minerva emerged victorious and proceeded to eradicate the human race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, all was not lost. Maia managed to take over a cloning facility and tasked you, Commander Class Clone #3148, with the critical mission of establishing new human outposts in remote locations around the world. </p>", "short_description": "The game is an unholy blend of base defense, tower defense, roguelite elements, and some colony management. Also, mechs.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327950/header.jpg?t=1780989954", "ca